    "starter_code": "#include <stdio.h>\n#include <stdlib.h>\n\ntypedef struct BSTNode {\n    int val;\n    struct BSTNode *left;\n    struct BSTNode *right;\n} BSTNode;\n\n// TODO: Serialize to preorder, deserialize back, print postorder\n\nint main(void) {\n    return 0;\n}\n",
